MCP: Model Context Protocol

RAG: Retrieval-Augmented Generation
User's Question
↓
Retrieval
↓
Find relevant company documents
↓
Put the relevant content into the prompt
↓
LLM
↓
Generate an answer

Retrieval:
convert docs into vector embedding and store them into DB, once the word embedding for the question is generated, it will be compared to the embedding of the docs.
this is semantic search, instead of keywords matching, the meaning and context of the query is used to match against the existing docs. 
then search results append to the prompt that serves as an augmented knowledge.

Augmentation:
the process where the retrieved data is injected into the prompt at runtime.
